Copyright (c) 2026 jorusid. All Rights Reserved.

1. PERMITTED (no prior permission required)
   1.1 Download, install and play this mod.
   1.2 Use it in singleplayer, on your own server, or on a friend's server.
   1.3 Include the unmodified original JAR, as-is, in a modpack or server client pack, provided that:
       (a) no fee is charged for access to this mod specifically;
       (b) the author (jorusid) and a link to this repository are clearly credited;
       (c) you do not claim authorship of this mod.
   1.4 Modify the mod for personal use and run the modified version on your own devices.
   1.5 Quote portions of the source for study, discussion, review, tutorials or news reporting.

2. PROHIBITED (prior written permission required)
   2.1 Redistributing modified versions (renamed, re-iconed, re-packaged, or partially modified)
       on any platform, whether free or paid, with or without credit.
   2.2 Any commercial use, including paid downloads, paywalls, ad-gated access, bundling for sale,
       or inclusion in a paid service.
   2.3 Copying this project's code, in whole or in substance, into another published project.
   2.4 Removing or obscuring author information or copyright notices.
   2.5 Circumventing these restrictions by any means, including publishing a rebranded copy.

3. RESERVED RIGHTS
   The author retains all rights, including the right to change these terms, change the license,
   stop maintaining, delete the repository, or withdraw downloads at any time. Historical releases
   remain governed by the terms in effect when they were published; changes are not retroactive
   to lawful use that already occurred.

4. DISCLAIMER
   This mod is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Extreme values may crash the game,
   corrupt worlds, destroy frame rate, or overheat hardware. The author is not liable for any
   direct or indirect damages arising from its use. Use constitutes acceptance of these risks.

5. PERMISSION REQUESTS
   For rights not expressly granted above (e.g. modified redistribution inside a modpack,
   commercial video/streaming collaboration, derivative projects), contact the author
   through the Issues section of this repository, stating the intended use.
